{"seq":1,"slug":"instruments-profiling","title":"Instruments 性能分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-development/performance/instruments-profiling","wordCount":1740,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"instruments-性能分析\">Instruments 性能分析</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>性能问题是用户体验的隐形杀手——卡顿、发热、耗电往往比功能缺陷更容易导致用户流失。Instruments 是 Xcode 内置的性能分析工具集，它通过 DTrace 和系统级 tracing 框架采集运行时数据，帮助开发者从 CPU、内存、网络、渲染等多个维度精确定位性能瓶颈。</p>\n<p>与打印日志或肉眼观察不同，Instruments 提供<strong>可量化、可回溯</strong>的数据链路。掌握 Instruments 的使用方法是 iOS 性能优化的第一步，也是从&quot;感觉慢&quot;到&quot;知道哪里慢&quot;的关键跨越。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    INS[&quot;Instruments Toolkit&quot;] --&gt; TP[&quot;Time Profiler&lt;br/&gt;CPU Timing&quot;]&#10;    INS --&gt; AL[&quot;Allocations&lt;br/&gt;MemoryAllocate&quot;]&#10;    INS --&gt; LK[&quot;Leaks&lt;br/&gt;MemoryLeak&quot;]&#10;    INS --&gt; NW[&quot;Network&lt;br/&gt;Network Activity&quot;]&#10;    INS --&gt; CA[&quot;Core Animation&lt;br/&gt;Rendering Performance&quot;]&#10;    INS --&gt; SP[&quot;os_signpost&lt;br/&gt;Custom Signpost&quot;]&#10;    WF[&quot;Workflow&quot;] --&gt; REC[&quot;Record&quot;]&#10;    WF --&gt; ANA[&quot;Analyze&quot;]&#10;    WF --&gt; LOC[&quot;Locate&quot;]&#10;    WF --&gt; FIX[&quot;Fix&quot;]&#10;    INS --- WF\">flowchart TD\n    INS[\"Instruments Toolkit\"] --&gt; TP[\"Time Profiler&lt;br/&gt;CPU Timing\"]\n    INS --&gt; AL[\"Allocations&lt;br/&gt;MemoryAllocate\"]\n    INS --&gt; LK[\"Leaks&lt;br/&gt;MemoryLeak\"]\n    INS --&gt; NW[\"Network&lt;br/&gt;Network Activity\"]\n    INS --&gt; CA[\"Core Animation&lt;br/&gt;Rendering Performance\"]\n    INS --&gt; SP[\"os_signpost&lt;br/&gt;Custom Signpost\"]\n    WF[\"Workflow\"] --&gt; REC[\"Record\"]\n    WF --&gt; ANA[\"Analyze\"]\n    WF --&gt; LOC[\"Locate\"]\n    WF --&gt; FIX[\"Fix\"]\n    INS --- WF</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>性能优化的第一原则是<strong>先度量、再优化</strong>：用数据定位真正的瓶颈，而不是凭感觉改代码。Instruments 提供可量化、可回溯的运行时数据。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>度量优先</strong>：先测量再动手，避免优化了不重要的路径</li>\n<li><strong>多维视角</strong>：CPU、内存、网络、渲染各有专用模板</li>\n<li><strong>闭环流程</strong>：录制 → 分析 → 定位 → 修复，并在 Release 配置下验证</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">模板</th>\n<th align=\"left\">观测维度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Time Profiler</td>\n<td align=\"left\">CPU 时间分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Allocations / Leaks</td>\n<td align=\"left\">内存分配与泄漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Core Animation</td>\n<td align=\"left\">渲染帧率与图层合成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>os_signpost</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">自定义埋点的时间区间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心工具\">核心工具</h2><h3 id=\"time-profiler\">Time Profiler</h3><p>Time Profiler 以固定时间间隔（默认 1ms）对所有线程进行<strong>采样</strong>，记录当前调用栈。通过统计各函数出现在栈顶的频率，推算出 CPU 时间分布。它不是精确计时，而是统计采样——样本量越大越准确。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Recording Mode</td>\n<td>Deferred（推迟写入磁盘，减少对性能的干扰）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Call Tree</td>\n<td>按调用树聚合，Bottom Up 视图更易定位热点函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Separate by Thread</td>\n<td>区分主线程和后台线程的 CPU 占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hide System Libraries</td>\n<td>过滤系统库调用，聚焦业务代码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"allocations\">Allocations</h3><p>Allocations 追踪每一次堆内存分配和释放，可以查看：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>All Heap Allocations</strong>：所有堆对象的分配记录</li>\n<li><strong>Allocation Summary</strong>：按类名统计存活对象数量和总大小</li>\n<li><strong>Mark Generation</strong>：在特定时间点打标，对比两次标记之间的内存增长</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"leaks\">Leaks</h3><p>Leaks 周期性扫描堆内存，检测<strong>不可达但未释放</strong>的对象（即循环引用导致的泄漏）。每次扫描会在时间线上显示红色叉号，点击可查看泄漏对象的引用链。</p>\n<h3 id=\"network\">Network</h3><p>Network 模板记录所有 URLSession 的网络请求，包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>请求 URL、HTTP 方法、状态码</li>\n<li>请求/响应大小</li>\n<li>连接复用情况（HTTP/2 Multiplexing）</li>\n<li>DNS 解析、TLS 握手、等待首字节（TTFB）等各阶段耗时</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"core-animation\">Core Animation</h3><p>Core Animation 模板（需要真机）度量渲染性能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FPS</strong>：帧率曲线</li>\n<li><strong>Color Blended Layers</strong>：图层混合区域（红色表示混合）</li>\n<li><strong>Color Offscreen-Rendered</strong>：离屏渲染区域（黄色）</li>\n<li><strong>Color Hits Green / Misses Red</strong>：光栅化缓存命中情况</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h2><p>Instruments 分析遵循 <strong>录制 → 分析 → 定位 → 修复</strong> 的闭环流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    R[&quot;1. Record&lt;br/&gt;Profile Mode Run App&lt;br/&gt;Execute Target Operations&quot;] --&gt; A[&quot;2. Analyze&lt;br/&gt;View Timeline&lt;br/&gt;Identify Anomaly Peaks&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; L[&quot;3. Locate&lt;br/&gt;Expand Call Stack&lt;br/&gt;Find hot functions&quot;]&#10;    L --&gt; F[&quot;4. Fix&lt;br/&gt;Optimize Code&lt;br/&gt;Re-profile to Verify&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;Not Met&quot;| R&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;Met ✅&quot;| D[&quot;Done&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    R[\"1. Record&lt;br/&gt;Profile Mode Run App&lt;br/&gt;Execute Target Operations\"] --&gt; A[\"2. Analyze&lt;br/&gt;View Timeline&lt;br/&gt;Identify Anomaly Peaks\"]\n    A --&gt; L[\"3. Locate&lt;br/&gt;Expand Call Stack&lt;br/&gt;Find hot functions\"]\n    L --&gt; F[\"4. Fix&lt;br/&gt;Optimize Code&lt;br/&gt;Re-profile to Verify\"]\n    F --&gt;|\"Not Met\"| R\n    F --&gt;|\"Met ✅\"| D[\"Done\"]</pre><h3 id=\"步骤一-录制\">步骤一：录制</h3><p>在 Xcode 中通过 <strong>Product → Profile (⌘I)</strong> 以 Release 配置编译并启动 Instruments。选择合适的模板后点击红色录制按钮，然后在 App 中执行目标操作（如滑动列表、打开页面、触发网络请求）。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>关键原则</strong>：始终使用 Release 配置 Profile。Debug 配置会关闭编译器优化，导致性能数据严重失真。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"步骤二-分析\">步骤二：分析</h3><p>停止录制后，在时间线上观察异常区域：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Time Profiler 中 CPU 占用率持续 100% 的区间</li>\n<li>Allocations 中内存持续攀升不回落的曲线</li>\n<li>Leaks 中出现红色叉号的时间点</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"步骤三-定位\">步骤三：定位</h3><p>选中异常区间后，在 Detail 面板中展开调用栈。使用 <strong>Bottom Up</strong> 视图查看 Self Weight 最高的函数——这些就是 CPU 热点。双击函数名可以直接跳转到源码。</p>\n<h3 id=\"步骤四-修复与验证\">步骤四：修复与验证</h3><p>修改代码后重新 Profile，对比优化前后的数据。建议记录每次 Profile 的关键指标（如峰值内存、平均帧率、启动耗时），形成可追溯的性能基线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战演示\">实战演示</h2><h3 id=\"使用-time-profiler-定位-cpu-热点\">使用 Time Profiler 定位 CPU 热点</h3><p>假设列表滑动卡顿，使用 Time Profiler 分析后发现 <code>formatDate</code> 在主线程被频繁调用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"class MessageCell: UITableViewCell {&#10;    private static let dateFormatter: DateFormatter = {&#10;        let formatter = DateFormatter()&#10;        formatter.dateFormat = &quot;yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm&quot;&#10;        return formatter&#10;    }()&#10;&#10;    func configure(with message: Message) {&#10;        titleLabel.text = message.title&#10;        dateLabel.text = Self.dateFormatter.string(from: message.date)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MessageCell</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UITableViewCell </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dateFormatter: DateFormatter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> formatter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DateFormatter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        formatter.dateFormat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> formatter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> configure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> message: Message) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        titleLabel.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> message.title</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dateLabel.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dateFormatter.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: message.date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>优化前，每次调用 <code>configure</code> 都创建新的 <code>DateFormatter</code>（该对象创建成本极高）。优化后将其提升为 <code>static</code> 属性，全局只创建一次。</p>\n<h3 id=\"使用-os_signpost-自定义性能埋点\">使用 os_signpost 自定义性能埋点</h3><p>当 Instruments 的标准模板无法满足需求时，可以使用 <code>os_signpost</code> API 在代码中插入自定义性能区间，配合 Instruments 的 <strong>os_signpost</strong> 模板查看：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import os.signpost&#10;&#10;extension OSLog {&#10;    static let networking = OSLog(subsystem: &quot;com.app.network&quot;, category: &quot;Networking&quot;)&#10;    static let imageLoading = OSLog(subsystem: &quot;com.app.image&quot;, category: &quot;ImageLoading&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;class APIClient {&#10;    func fetchUser(id: String) async throws -&gt; User {&#10;        let signpostID = OSSignpostID(log: .networking)&#10;        os_signpost(.begin, log: .networking, name: &quot;FetchUser&quot;, signpostID: signpostID,&#10;                    &quot;userID: %{public}@&quot;, id)&#10;&#10;        defer {&#10;            os_signpost(.end, log: .networking, name: &quot;FetchUser&quot;, signpostID: signpostID)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        let (data, _) = try await URLSession.shared.data(from: makeURL(for: id))&#10;        return try JSONDecoder().decode(User.self, from: data)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private func makeURL(for id: String) -&gt; URL {&#10;        URL(string: &quot;https://api.example.com/users/\\(id)&quot;)!&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> os</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">signpost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extension</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OSLog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> networking </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> OSLog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subsystem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.app.network\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Networking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> imageLoading </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> OSLog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subsystem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.app.image\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ImageLoading\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> APIClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signpostID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> OSSignpostID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .networking)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        os_signpost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.begin, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .networking, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"col