>-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> URL {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.example.com/users/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(id)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Instruments 中选择 <strong>os_signpost</strong> 模板，可以看到每次 <code>FetchUser</code> 操作的精确起止时间、持续时长，以及附带的上下文信息。</p>\n<h3 id=\"使用-pointsofinterest-标记关键事件\">使用 PointsOfInterest 标记关键事件</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import os.signpost&#10;&#10;class AppLifecycle {&#10;    private static let poi = OSLog(subsystem: &quot;com.app.lifecycle&quot;, category: .pointsOfInterest)&#10;&#10;    static func markFirstContentfulPaint() {&#10;        os_signpost(.event, log: poi, name: &quot;FirstContentfulPaint&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    static func markInteractive() {&#10;        os_signpost(.event, log: poi, name: &quot;TimeToInteractive&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> os</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">signpost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppLifecycle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> poi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> OSLog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subsystem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.app.lifecycle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .pointsOfInterest)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> markFirstContentfulPaint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        os_signpost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.event, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: poi, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FirstContentfulPaint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> markInteractive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        os_signpost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.event, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: poi, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TimeToInteractive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>pointsOfInterest</code> 类别的事件会直接显示在 Instruments 时间线顶部的 <strong>Points of Interest</strong> 泳道中，非常适合标记启动完成、首屏渲染等里程碑事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见问题\">常见问题</h2><h3 id=\"q-profile-的数据和-debug-运行差异很大\">Q：Profile 的数据和 Debug 运行差异很大？</h3><p>Instruments 使用 Release 配置编译（开启 -O 优化），而日常调试使用 Debug 配置（-Onone）。两者的代码执行路径和性能表现可能完全不同。应始终以 Release Profile 的数据为准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"q-time-profiler-看不到我的函数名\">Q：Time Profiler 看不到我的函数名？</h3><p>确保 Build Settings 中 <strong>Debug Information Format</strong> 设置为 <code>DWARF with dSYM File</code>。如果使用了 Swift Package 或第三方库，确保它们也生成了 dSYM。</p>\n<h3 id=\"q-模拟器上可以用-instruments-吗\">Q：模拟器上可以用 Instruments 吗？</h3><p>大部分模板支持模拟器，但 <strong>Core Animation</strong>、<strong>GPU Driver</strong> 等与硬件紧密相关的模板只能在<strong>真机</strong>上运行。建议始终使用真机进行性能分析。</p>\n<h3 id=\"q-如何分析后台线程的性能\">Q：如何分析后台线程的性能？</h3><p>在 Time Profiler 中勾选 <strong>Separate by Thread</strong>，可以单独查看每个线程的 CPU 占用。GCD 创建的线程名称通常为 <code>com.apple.root.default-qos</code>，可以在代码中用 <code>Thread.current.name</code> 设置自定义线程名以便识别。</p>\n<h3 id=\"q-instruments-录制时-app-卡顿严重\">Q：Instruments 录制时 App 卡顿严重？</h3><p>录制本身有一定开销。使用 <strong>Deferred Mode</strong>（File → Recording Options → Deferred）可以减少录制期间的干扰，数据在停止录制后才写入磁盘。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Instruments</strong> 是 Xcode 内置的性能分析工具集，覆盖 CPU、内存、网络、渲染等核心维度。</li>\n<li><strong>Time Profiler</strong> 通过采样统计 CPU 时间分布，Bottom Up 视图可快速定位热点函数。</li>\n<li><strong>Allocations</strong> 追踪堆内存分配，配合 Mark Generation 可检测内存持续增长。</li>\n<li><strong>Leaks</strong> 自动检测循环引用导致的内存泄漏，红色叉号标记泄漏时间点。</li>\n<li><strong>Core Animation</strong> 模板（真机专用）度量帧率、图层混合、离屏渲染等渲染性能指标。</li>\n<li><strong>os_signpost</strong> 提供自定义性能埋点能力，可在 Instruments 中查看精确的时间区间和事件标记。</li>\n<li>性能分析遵循<strong>录制 → 分析 → 定位 → 修复</strong>的闭环流程，始终使用 Release 配置。</li>\n<li>建议建立性能基线，每次优化后对比关键指标，确保改进可量化、可追溯。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Instruments 性能分析","id":"instruments-性能分析"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心工具","id":"核心工具"},{"level":3,"text":"Time Profiler","id":"time-profiler"},{"level":3,"text":"Allocations","id":"allocations"},{"level":3,"text":"Leaks","id":"leaks"},{"level":3,"text":"Network","id":"network"},{"level":3,"text":"Core Animation","id":"core-animation"},{"level":2,"text":"工作流程","id":"工作流程"},{"level":3,"text":"步骤一：录制","id":"步骤一-录制"},{"level":3,"text":"步骤二：分析","id":"步骤二-分析"},{"level":3,"text":"步骤三：定位","id":"步骤三-定位"},{"level":3,"text":"步骤四：修复与验证","id":"步骤四-修复与验证"},{"level":2,"text":"实战演示","id":"实战演示"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 Time Profiler 定位 CPU 热点","id":"使用-time-profiler-定位-cpu-热点"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 os_signpost 自定义性能埋点","id":"使用-os_signpost-自定义性能埋点"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 PointsOfInterest 标记关键事件","id":"使用-pointsofinterest-标记关键事件"},{"level":2,"text":"常见问题","id":"常见问题"},{"level":3,"text":"Q：Profile 的数据和 Debug 运行差异很大？","id":"q-profile-的数据和-debug-运行差异很大"},{"level":3,"text":"Q：Time Profiler 看不到我的函数名？","id":"q-time-profiler-看不到我的函数名"},{"level":3,"text":"Q：模拟器上可以用 Instruments 吗？","id":"q-模拟器上可以用-instruments-吗"},{"level":3,"text":"Q：如何分析后台线程的性能？","id":"q-如何分析后台线程的性能"},{"level":3,"text":"Q：Instruments 录制时 App 卡顿严重？","id":"q-instruments-录制时-app-卡顿严重"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"TDD 工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-development/testing/tdd-workflow"},"next":{"title":"内存优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-development/performance/memory-optimization"}}